== ForeignNotRemoved
DefenseClaw couldn't remove sandbox build-1 (still Provisioning): remove it with `openshell sandbox delete build-1`; your organization requires sandboxes started with defenseclaw sandbox run.
== ForeignAlerted
Sandbox build-1 wasn't started with defenseclaw sandbox run, which your organization requires; your organization was told.
